Eka
$cards
DECK 1 SPADES

$initial
VUID 9 FACE_HALF
VUID 4 FACE_ALL

$moves
MOVE VUID VUID
OR
    AND
        DEST Suit {SPADES, DIAMONDS, HEARTS, CLUBS}
        DESTSRC Rank equal
    DEST Rank 1
$win
OR
    AND
        PILE ALL VUID Empty
        PILE ALL VUID Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL VUID Empty
        PILE ALL VUID Empty
